Package: dbus
Version: @DEB_DBUS_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/dbus/
Depends: libiosexec1
Description: Simple interprocess messaging system (daemon, tools and library)
 D-Bus is a message bus, used for sending messages between applications. This
 package contains the libdbus-1 shared library, the dbus-daemon, and tools such
 as dbus-launch and dbus-uuidgen. Provides the session bus needed by GNOME apps
 (dconf/GLib) and by xfconf.
